            <title>0.3.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 04 Oct 2026 19:28:43 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/owenzhao/Better-Switch</link>
            <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Shake a window's title bar to focus on that window.</p>
<ul>
<li>Minimizes other windows, with automatic app hiding when minimization is unavailable.</li>
<li>Shakes again to restore the changed windows and bring the shaken window forward.</li>
<li>Supports continuous shaking while holding the title bar, with a 1.2-second cooldown between actions.</li>
<li>Adds Restore Shaken Windows to the menu bar.</li>
</ul>
<p>The shaken window's own app is never hidden. Hiding another app can also hide its windows on other desktops.</p>
]]></description>
